index 2b7bae0b..9fd489d2 100644
--- a/state/LEARNING_STATE.md
+++ b/state/LEARNING_STATE.md
@@ -67,3 +67,37 @@ Prefer the highest-value unresolved frontier cell over repeating an equivalent e
 5. Preserve negative and inconclusive evidence.
 6. Do not claim a strategy delta worked until its expected effect is actually observed.
 7. When there is insufficient evidence, choose UNVERIFIED rather than forcing RETAIN or REVERT.
+
+## Process audit — P-001 (activation 45849553653, campaign slot 01, 2026-11-26)
+
+Audited whether the focused-task selector demonstrably improves learning
+efficiency relative to the prior opportunistic queue choice. This note qualifies
+but does not erase the earlier "Decision: RETAIN (verified)" line above.
+
+Finding: the selector advantage is UNVERIFIED, not demonstrated.
+
+Evidence:
+- The per-activation learning-history rows themselves mark the process delta
+  UNVERIFIED for 37260572520 ("the objective came from the queued receipt item
+  rather than a frontier cell") and 37318950814 ("UNVERIFIED (process delta)"),
+  while the top-level Active strategy delta reads "RETAIN (verified)". That
+  "verified" label refers to the research verdicts being independently
+  recomputed, not to the process-selection claim being independently verified.
+- The evidence basis "five recent frontier cells closed without equivalent
+  retests" describes cells run by the predecessor single-agent LEARNING_STATE
+  frontier mechanism (37263008074 .. 37414038601). The current campaign
+  controller instead selects from state/campaign/task_queue.json by
+  "qualitative_evidence_backed_priority"; no durable evidence compares that
+  controller selector against the prior opportunistic mode.
+- No controlled comparison exists: the frontier-first period coincides with the
+  synthetic -> real-data transition and with codebase maturation (more gates and
+  verifiers), so any change in information flow is confounded and cannot be
+  attributed to the selection mechanism alone.
+- "No equivalent retests" is a novelty property of the chosen cells, not a
+  measurement of selection efficiency; it is necessary but not sufficient.
+
+Conclusion: no concrete selector advantage and no demonstrated harm. The honest
+process decision is UNVERIFIED. A future bounded task should realign the
+top-level label with the per-activation rows and, separately, define a consistent
+qualitative information-flow rubric before any stronger claim. Recorded as
+candidate tasks P-007 and P-008 in the agent_01 record for run 45849553653.
